0325: battery percent (tester bug 9). Start from Android's QG SoC in PM7250B SDAM (sid 2 0xb100 +0x46 valid, +0x47 soc,
+0x54 RTC time, +0x80 magic 0x12345678) when stamped by the PM6125 RTC (sid 0 0x6048) no more than sweetbat_sdam_age (600) s
ago; otherwise the cell's own OCV curve (25 C column of the guanyu-5000mAh profile in sapphire's dtbo) replaces the generic one.
Then integrate the QG current every poll over 5020 mAh; the OCV pulls slowly at light load and fully when the gauge is not
sampling. Shown: only the way the current goes, 99 until full. Read only; logs charger APSD/ICL/FCC/JEITA for the charge study.

